  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides"><head>ΚΟΛΧΙΔΕΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="300" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-300" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides">
            <note type="source">Auctor argumenti Promethei Æschylei: Keῖται δὲ ἡ μυθοποιία ἐν παρεκβάσει παρὰ Σοφοκλεῖ ἐν Κόλχοις.</note>
          </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="311" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-311" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:321">
            <note type="source">Stobaeus XXII, 23.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Καλὸν φρονεῖν τὸν θνητὸν ἀνθρώποις ἴσα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="312" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-312" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:320">
            <note type="source">Athenaeus XIII. p. 602 e. Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Κολχίσι περὶ Γανυμήδους τινὰ λόγον ποιούμενος</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Μηροῖς ὑπαίθων τὴν Διὸς τυραννίδα.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="313" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-313" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:315">
            <note type="source">Grammaticus Bekkeri p. 404, 19. et Suidas, Ἀνθυπουργῆσαι χάριν : τὸ ἀνταποδοῦναι. Σ. Κολχίσιν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἦ φὴς ὑπομνὺς ἀνθυπουργῆσαι χάριν;</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="314" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-314" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:317">
            <note type="source">Schol. Apollonii Rhodii ΙΙΙ, 1371. Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Κολχίσι πεποίηκε τοῦ ἀγγέλου τὸν Αἰήτην πυθόμενον περὶ τῶν προειρημένων οὕτως</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἦ βλαστὸς οὐκ ἔβλαστεν οὑπιχώριος,</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">καὶ κάρτα φρίξας εὐλόφῳ σφηκώματι,</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">χαλκηλάτοις ὅπλοισι μητρὸς ἐξέδυ;</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="314b" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-314b" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides">
            <note type="source">Vide fragm. 216.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="315" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-315" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides">
            <note type="source">De morte Apsyrti: vide fragm. 491.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="316" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-316" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:322">
            <note type="source">Hesychius, Ἐπαλλαχθεῖσα: ἐπαλλάξασα. Σ. Κολχίσιν.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="317" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-317" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.pearson1917-grc1:340">
            <note type="source">Etymolog. M. p. 439, 1. Σ. Κόλχοις.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ὑμεῖς μὲν οὐκ ἄρ᾽ ἦστε τὸν Προμηθέα.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">ἀντὶ τοῦ ᾔδειτε.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="318" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-318" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:323">
            <note type="source">Athenaeus II. p. 70 a. Κινάρα: ταύτην Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Κολχίσι κυνάραν καλεῖ. Ex epitome Eustathius p. 1822, 17.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="319" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-319" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides">
            <note type="source">Galenus vol. IX. p. 385. Charter. (V. p. 454. Basil.) Δοκεῖ μὲν γὰρ αὐτὴν (τὴν πέμφιγα) ἐπὶ τῆς πνοῆς Σοφοκλῆς ἐν Κόλχοις λέγειν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἀπῇξε πέμφιξιν οὐ πέλας φόρου.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">—ἐπὶ δὲ τῶν ἀκτίνων αὐτῶν δοκεῖ χρῆσθαι τῷ ὀνόματι Σ. ἐν Κόλχοις κατὰ τάδε τὰ ἔπη</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Κἂν ἐθαύμασας</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">τηλέσκοπον πέμφιγα χρυσέαν ἰδών.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="apparatus">Versum primum Hermannus in dissertatione de Æschyli Prometheo soluto p. 24. ita corrigit, Ἀπῇξε πέμφιξ ὡς ἰπνοῦ σελασφόρου. Idem in altero loco emendavit vulgatum ἐθαύμασα.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="320" xml:id="fragment-kolchides-dindorf1893_grc1-320" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0011_kolchides" sameAs="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0011.kolchides.nauck1889grc1:312">
            <note type="source">Scholiasta Pindari Pyth. IV, 398. Τοὺς πυρίπνους ταύρους Ἀντίμαχος ἐν Λύδῃ Ἡφαιστοτεύκτους λέγει. καὶ Σοφοκλῆς δὲ χαλκοῦς βοῦς ἀδερμάτους φησὶν</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Χαλκοσκελεῖς γὰρ</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">ἐκπνέουσι πνευμάτων ἄπο·</l>
              <l n="3" xml:lang="grc">φλέγει δὲ μυκτὴρ, ὡς</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
